$ gate next ns stage status=findings count=1 minors=1
logged: review=1-open scope=stage round=1
next=fix
do: move the stage card to inprogress, resume its implementer with the review file, then the gauntlet and the same reviewer's follow-up
guide: ferrule guide show stage-review --slug ns
exit=0
$ gate next ns stage status=clean minors=2
logged: review=clean scope=stage minors=2
next=minors then=stage-stop
do: resume the implementer to fix the minors the verdict lists (count 2), with no review after the fix, then the step below
run: ferrule stage stop ns s2 --threads <n>
do: run the stage stop decision with the PR thread count
guide: ferrule guide show stage-review --slug ns
exit=0
log:
2026-10-05T09:00 review=1-open scope=stage round=1
2026-10-05T09:00 review=clean scope=stage minors=2
